# Leave empty in development (Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:4000) and when the API
# serves the admin panel at /admin (the default deployment): both are the same origin.
#
# Only when hosting the admin panel on its OWN domain: set the full API URL here, build with
# ADMIN_BASE=/, add the admin's URL to CLIENT_URLS and set COOKIE_SAMESITE=none on the API.
VITE_API_URL=
